# Styling Guidelines

## Tailwind CSS - Mobile First

```tsx
// ✅ ALWAYS start with mobile
<div className="
  flex flex-col gap-2        // Mobile base
  sm:flex-row sm:gap-4       // Tablet
  lg:gap-6                   // Desktop
">
```

## Class Order (Recommended)

```tsx
<div className="
  {/* 1. Layout */}
  flex flex-col items-center justify-between
  
  {/* 2. Size */}
  w-full h-auto min-h-screen
  
  {/* 3. Spacing */}
  p-4 m-2 gap-4
  
  {/* 4. Typography */}
  text-base font-medium text-gray-900
  
  {/* 5. Background and borders */}
  bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg
  
  {/* 6. Effects */}
  shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow
  
  {/* 7. Responsive (always last) */}
  md:flex-row md:p-6 lg:p-8
">
```

## cn() Utility for Conditional Classes

```tsx
import { cn } from '@/lib/utils';

interface ButtonProps {
  variant?: 'primary' | 'secondary';
  disabled?: boolean;
}

function Button({ variant = 'primary', disabled, className }: ButtonProps) {
  return (
    <button
      className={cn(
        // Base styles
        'px-4 py-2 rounded-md font-medium transition-colors',
        // Variants
        {
          'bg-primary text-white hover:bg-primary/90': variant === 'primary',
          'bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground': variant === 'secondary',
        },
        // States
        disabled && 'opacity-50 cursor-not-allowed',
        // Allow override
        className
      )}
    />
  );
}
```

## shadcn/ui - Correct Usage

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD: Import shadcn components
import { Button } from '@/components/ui/button';
import { Card, CardHeader, CardContent } from '@/components/ui/card';
import { Input } from '@/components/ui/input';

// ✅ GOOD: Extend with className
<Button className="w-full md:w-auto">
  Book Now
</Button>

// ✅ GOOD: Use shadcn variants
<Button variant="outline" size="sm">
  Cancel
</Button>
```

## Semantic Colors

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD: Use shadcn CSS variables
<div className="bg-background text-foreground">
<div className="bg-primary text-primary-foreground">
<div className="bg-destructive text-destructive-foreground">
<div className="border-border">
<div className="text-muted-foreground">

// ❌ BAD: Hardcoded colors
<div className="bg-blue-500 text-white">
```

## Consistent Spacing

```tsx
// Spacing system (multiples of 4)
// 1 = 4px, 2 = 8px, 4 = 16px, 6 = 24px, 8 = 32px

// ✅ GOOD: Consistent spacing
<div className="p-4 space-y-4">     // 16px
<div className="p-6 space-y-6">     // 24px

// ❌ BAD: Arbitrary spacing
<div className="p-[13px] space-y-[7px]">
```

## Dark Mode Ready

```tsx
// ✅ Prepare for dark mode (even if not implemented now)
<div className="bg-white dark:bg-gray-900">
<p className="text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">

// ✅ BETTER: Use semantic variables
<div className="bg-background text-foreground">
```

## Responsive Typography

```tsx
// ✅ Responsive text
<h1 className="text-2xl font-bold md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl">
<p className="text-sm md:text-base">
<span className="text-xs text-muted-foreground">
```
